{
    "_comment": "Non-secret bot settings. `enabled_commands` may also be a plain true/false to turn every cog on/off. Command names live in `aliases`; command enable flags live in `real`. The Minelink Components V2 look is configured in `embeds.components_v2` \u2014 every key is optional and defaults to the current card design.",
